{"id":68,"title":"集合运算","summary":"让我们来看看如何在Python中进行集合运算操作。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d95d77c8fabe11eb8c333af9d3c2d1d5","text":"熟悉数学的人都知道，集合有三个主要的运算，即**并集**`union`、**交集**`intersection`和**差集**`difference`。\n\nPython中的集合数据结构支持所有这三种。\n\n## 并集Union\n\n两个集合的交集是两个集合中所有元素去重后的集合。","text_html":"<p>熟悉数学的人都知道，集合有三个主要的运算，即<strong>并集</strong><code>union</code>、<strong>交集</strong><code>intersection</code>和<strong>差集</strong><code>difference</code>。</p>\n<p>Python中的集合数据结构支持所有这三种。</p>\n<h2>并集Union</h2>\n<p>两个集合的交集是两个集合中所有元素去重后的集合。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d95d798afabe11eb8c333af9d3c2d1d5","image_id":5878408866693120,"file":"/content/assets/f65042449881f735d440.png","style":"original","caption":"并集Union","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":360,"height":263,"size_in_bytes":29561,"name":"4965897418571776.png"},"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d95d79e4fabe11eb8c333af9d3c2d1d5","text":"在Python中，可以使用操作符`|`，或者`union()`方法来进行求交集：","text_html":"<p>在Python中，可以使用操作符<code>|</code>，或者<code>union()</code>方法来进行求交集：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d95d7a2afabe11eb8c333af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"set_A = {1, 2, 3, 4}\nset_B = {'a', 'b', 'c', 'd'}\n\nprint(set_A | set_B)\nprint(set_A.union(set_B))\nprint(set_B.union(set_A))\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d95d7a5cfabe11eb8c333af9d3c2d1d5","text":"由于集合是无序的，上面三个输出顺序并不重要。\n\n## 交集Intersection\n\n两个集合的交集是它们之间相同元素的集合：","text_html":"<p>由于集合是无序的，上面三个输出顺序并不重要。</p>\n<h2>交集Intersection</h2>\n<p>两个集合的交集是它们之间相同元素的集合：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":4},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d95d7a98fabe11eb8c333af9d3c2d1d5","image_id":4580642219622400,"file":"/content/assets/d5a9bd0e490a2cabcd7a.png","style":"original","caption":"交集Intersection","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":360,"height":262,"size_in_bytes":24509,"name":"6726721602584576.png"},"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d95d7acafabe11eb8c333af9d3c2d1d5","text":"在Python中，可以使用`&`操作符或`intersection()`方法来求交集：","text_html":"<p>在Python中，可以使用<code>&amp;</code>操作符或<code>intersection()</code>方法来求交集：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":6},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d95d7afcfabe11eb8c333af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"set_A = {1, 2, 3, 4}\nset_B = {2, 8, 4, 16}\n\nprint(set_A & set_B)\nprint(set_A.intersection(set_B))\nprint(set_B.intersection(set_A))\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":7},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d95d7b2efabe11eb8c333af9d3c2d1d5","text":"## 差集Difference\n\n两个集合的差集是第一个集合中存在，但第二个集合中不存在的所有元素的集合：","text_html":"<h2>差集Difference</h2>\n<p>两个集合的差集是第一个集合中存在，但第二个集合中不存在的所有元素的集合：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":8},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d95d7b6afabe11eb8c333af9d3c2d1d5","image_id":5054538576297984,"file":"/content/assets/57c3f128a082f547bfab.png","style":"original","caption":"差集Difference","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":360,"height":262,"size_in_bytes":25435,"name":"5980996027547648.png"},"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":9},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d95d7b9cfabe11eb8c333af9d3c2d1d5","text":"在Python中，两个集合之间的差集可以用`-`运算符或`difference()`方法找到。\n\n请记住，求**差集**操作非交换性的，所以两个集合的前后顺序比较重要：\n\n- `set_A - set_B`返回只存在于`set_A`的元素。\n\n- `set_B - set_A`返回只存在于`set_B`的元素。","text_html":"<p>在Python中，两个集合之间的差集可以用<code>-</code>运算符或<code>difference()</code>方法找到。</p>\n<p>请记住，求<strong>差集</strong>操作非交换性的，所以两个集合的前后顺序比较重要：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><code>set_A - set_B</code>返回只存在于<code>set_A</code>的元素。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>set_B - set_A</code>返回只存在于<code>set_B</code>的元素。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":10},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d95d7bcefabe11eb8c333af9d3c2d1d5","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"set_A = {1, 2, 3, 4}\nset_B = {2, 8, 4, 16}\n\n\nprint(set_A - set_B)\nprint(set_A.difference(set_B))\n\nprint(set_B - set_A)\nprint(set_B.difference(set_A))\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":11},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d95d7c00fabe11eb8c333af9d3c2d1d5","text":"至此，我们已经对Python中数据结构列表、元组、字典、集合进行了全面的介绍。熟练掌握它们，可以增加你解决问题的工具。\n\n---\n\n在下一课，我们将学习如何将一种数据结构转换为另一种。","text_html":"<p>至此，我们已经对Python中数据结构列表、元组、字典、集合进行了全面的介绍。熟练掌握它们，可以增加你解决问题的工具。</p>\n<hr />\n<p>在下一课，我们将学习如何将一种数据结构转换为另一种。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":12}],"status":"undo","course_no":"002","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/002/page/68"}
